# UI Smoke Tests and Deslop
RULE: Before UI commits: run type-check + lint; optionally /run-smoke-tests (Playwright) and /deslop (clean AI slop).
WHY: Validates critical flows and removes AI-generated code slop before merge.
CODEX: 14-testing-guides/UI_SMOKE_TESTING_GUIDE.md, 06-coding-standards/code-cleanup-deslop.md
DO: Use `/run-smoke-tests` for UI changes; `/deslop` before commit; `npm run smoketest` manually
NEVER: Skip type-check/lint for UI; commit without smoke tests for major UI changes
